    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord</h1><p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/wishlist_follow.gif?t=1752419266\" /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/298ee66cbab2f61cb52f21aa2b7ca1b4.poster.avif?t=1752419266\" width=600 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/298ee66cbab2f61cb52f21aa2b7ca1b4.webm?t=1752419266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/298ee66cbab2f61cb52f21aa2b7ca1b4.mp4?t=1752419266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Immerse yourself in a magical experience. Master elemental magic and use it to help you build your home and help villagers build theirs, expand your land, make new friends, and find love. Play in single-player or in co-op multiplayer with up to 4 players.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FARMING With ELEMENTS</strong></h2>Cultivate your very own piece of land with some magical crops. Use elemental powers to help you build up your farm.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/509e5e69d66851ac799f40c7f74dbf75.poster.avif?t=1752419266\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/509e5e69d66851ac799f40c7f74dbf75.webm?t=1752419266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/509e5e69d66851ac799f40c7f74dbf75.mp4?t=1752419266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR HOME</strong></h2>Personalize your character living space with a vast selection of Options And decorations. Build and expand your Home &amp; farm. Create your dream home!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/6d923fb6b874614a246749697576eb4b.poster.avif?t=1752419266\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/6d923fb6b874614a246749697576eb4b.webm?t=1752419266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/6d923fb6b874614a246749697576eb4b.mp4?t=1752419266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ELEMENTAL SPELLS</strong></h2>Try to master elemental magic: Earth, Water, Fire, Air. And unveil treasures that respond only to the elemental call.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/162b26ba38d7624024a04746d4fb4081.poster.avif?t=1752419266\" width=616 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/162b26ba38d7624024a04746d4fb4081.webm?t=1752419266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/162b26ba38d7624024a04746d4fb4081.mp4?t=1752419266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VIBRANT EXPLORATION</strong></h2>Roam across dynamic landscapes that shift with the day-night cycle. Witness a world that breathes, evolves, and welcomes the curious at every turn.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/f39cd025e75b66137fb874b20465219c.poster.avif?t=1752419266\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/f39cd025e75b66137fb874b20465219c.webm?t=1752419266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/f39cd025e75b66137fb874b20465219c.mp4?t=1752419266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRAVERSE MAGICAL WORLD</strong></h2>Soar, swim, climb, and blaze through diverse terrains using your elemental abilities, each providing a new perspective on the world's wonders.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/a34fcf35cfb9af92d58ba94eac391d9f.poster.avif?t=1752419266\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/a34fcf35cfb9af92d58ba94eac391d9f.webm?t=1752419266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/a34fcf35cfb9af92d58ba94eac391d9f.mp4?t=1752419266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROCEDURALLY GENERATED DUNGEONS</strong></h2>Explore procedurally generated dungeons that change in every run, mine ores. Fight elemental monsters and find out hidden treasures!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMMUNITY BUILDING</strong></h2>Make new friends, and find out more about what's going on in Mystood Haven, help build up the community and gain exclusive benefits.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER</strong></h2>Join forces with friends in a cooperative experience like no other. Farm, explore, and create shared narratives in a world where every action echoes with the magic of friendship.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RELATIONSHIPS</strong></h2>Find love among 12 potential partners, each with their own magical narrative. Celebrate marriage with a partner who will join you in farming and life's adventures.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2>Gender/sex, hairstyle, eyes, faces, skin tones, facial hairs, face painting, you can customize them all!",
    "about_the_game": "<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/298ee66cbab2f61cb52f21aa2b7ca1b4.poster.avif?t=1752419266\" width=600 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/298ee66cbab2f61cb52f21aa2b7ca1b4.webm?t=1752419266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/298ee66cbab2f61cb52f21aa2b7ca1b4.mp4?t=1752419266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Immerse yourself in a magical experience. Master elemental magic and use it to help you build your home and help villagers build theirs, expand your land, make new friends, and find love. Play in single-player or in co-op multiplayer with up to 4 players.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FARMING With ELEMENTS</strong></h2>Cultivate your very own piece of land with some magical crops. Use elemental powers to help you build up your farm.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/509e5e69d66851ac799f40c7f74dbf75.poster.avif?t=1752419266\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/509e5e69d66851ac799f40c7f74dbf75.webm?t=1752419266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/509e5e69d66851ac799f40c7f74dbf75.mp4?t=1752419266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR HOME</strong></h2>Personalize your character living space with a vast selection of Options And decorations. Build and expand your Home &amp; farm. Create your dream home!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/6d923fb6b874614a246749697576eb4b.poster.avif?t=1752419266\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/6d923fb6b874614a246749697576eb4b.webm?t=1752419266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/6d923fb6b874614a246749697576eb4b.mp4?t=1752419266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ELEMENTAL SPELLS</strong></h2>Try to master elemental magic: Earth, Water, Fire, Air. And unveil treasures that respond only to the elemental call.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/162b26ba38d7624024a04746d4fb4081.poster.avif?t=1752419266\" width=616 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/162b26ba38d7624024a04746d4fb4081.webm?t=1752419266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/162b26ba38d7624024a04746d4fb4081.mp4?t=1752419266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VIBRANT EXPLORATION</strong></h2>Roam across dynamic landscapes that shift with the day-night cycle. Witness a world that breathes, evolves, and welcomes the curious at every turn.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/f39cd025e75b66137fb874b20465219c.poster.avif?t=1752419266\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/f39cd025e75b66137fb874b20465219c.webm?t=1752419266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/f39cd025e75b66137fb874b20465219c.mp4?t=1752419266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRAVERSE MAGICAL WORLD</strong></h2>Soar, swim, climb, and blaze through diverse terrains using your elemental abilities, each providing a new perspective on the world's wonders.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/a34fcf35cfb9af92d58ba94eac391d9f.poster.avif?t=1752419266\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/a34fcf35cfb9af92d58ba94eac391d9f.webm?t=1752419266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/a34fcf35cfb9af92d58ba94eac391d9f.mp4?t=1752419266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROCEDURALLY GENERATED DUNGEONS</strong></h2>Explore procedurally generated dungeons that change in every run, mine ores. Fight elemental monsters and find out hidden treasures!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMMUNITY BUILDING</strong></h2>Make new friends, and find out more about what's going on in Mystood Haven, help build up the community and gain exclusive benefits.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER</strong></h2>Join forces with friends in a cooperative experience like no other. Farm, explore, and create shared narratives in a world where every action echoes with the magic of friendship.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RELATIONSHIPS</strong></h2>Find love among 12 potential partners, each with their own magical narrative. Celebrate marriage with a partner who will join you in farming and life's adventures.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2>Gender/sex, hairstyle, eyes, faces, skin tones, facial hairs, face painting, you can customize them all!",
    "short_description": "Cozy Crest is a cozy open world adventure game for 1-4 players. Master the elemental powers; Water, Earth, Fire, Air and explore a vast world abundant with magic. Make new friends and find love. Cultivate your farm, build up your land and shape a community that evolves with every action!",
